Description: A forked, Windows-focused build of freestiler that creates vector
    tile archives in 'PMTiles' format from 'sf' spatial data frames, files, and
    DuckDB SQL. Supports 'Mapbox Vector Tile' ('MVT') and 'MapLibre Tile'
    ('MLT') output formats. Uses a 'Rust' backend via 'extendr' with native
    DuckDB and GeoParquet support compiled in.
